const r16="- Game 16: White vs 20k, same rules. Draw after consecutive passes at moves 50–51. Independent area: Black 44, White 37 plus 7 komi. Final captures: 0 each. The nineteen-stone left group lived with true C1/D2 eyes; F6/G5/G6/H4/H5 were dead but remained on the final displayed board. Manually excluding those five stones reproduced the official draw.";
